  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "The Stone is grateful for your presence.\nIt says you are good to have near. That you should stay a while.\n\n\nYou have its blessing, if you need it.\nSo you may feel less alone.\nSo you do not have to listen to the silence.",
    "Text": "石头感谢你的到来。\\n它说，有你在身边真好，你应该多待一会儿。\\n\\n\\n如果你需要，它为你祝福。\\n这样，你就不会感到那么孤独。\\n这样，你就不必再独自面对寂静。",
    "zh": "石头感谢你的到来。\\n它说，有你在身边真好，你应该多待一会儿。\\n\\n\\n如果你需要，它为你祝福。\\n这样，你就不会感到那么孤独。\\n这样，你就不必再独自面对寂静。",
    "en": "The Stone is grateful for your presence.\\nIt says you are good to have near. That you should stay a while.\\n\\n\\nYou have its blessing, if you need it.\\nSo you may feel less alone.\\nSo you do not have to listen to the silence.",
    "ja": "The Stone is grateful for your presence.\nIt says you are good to have near. That you should stay a while.\n\n\nYou have its blessing, if you need it.\nSo you may feel less alone.\nSo you do not have to listen to the silence."
  },
